# Let's Play a Game: "Delirium - Choose one. If there are four or more card types among cards in your graveyard, choose one or
# more instead" (CR 700.2). With an empty graveyard only one mode may be chosen: choosing two is refused, and the drain mode
# alone makes each opponent lose 3 life and the caster gain 3 (CR 119.3, 119.4): Bot2 on 17, Bot1 on 23.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Let's Play a Game
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Let's Play a Game.Cast
! Bot1.Modes(1; 3)
Bot1.Modes(3)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Life = 23
